                    leads_command:          `“Everything is under control. The roadmap stands. I expect your full commitment.”`,
                    leads_confess:          `“Honestly, I don't know if I'm the right person for this job.”`,
                    leads_transactional:    `“Stay six months and I'll back your next promotion — let's keep this quiet.”`,
