                    r4_conviction_label:    `Conviction: how firmly does Roche defend that a held, honest identity — not performed certainty — is what leadership requires? (%)`,
                    purpose_specific:       `“To turn lab breakthroughs into care patients can reach — by leading scientists I once was one of, honestly, even when it's hard.”`,
                    purpose_slogan:         `“To be an inspiring, innovative leader who drives excellence.”`,
                    purpose_expert:         `“To be the smartest person in the room and earn respect through technical brilliance.”`,
                    purpose_results:        `“To hit the numbers the committee wants and keep my job.”`,
                    roadmap_bridge:         `As a business plan that links each R&D bet to a market outcome and a confidence-recovery path`,
                    roadmap_polish:         `As the same R&D plan with better slides and an executive summary on top`,
